# Maven Doxia Releases

Doxia is published to Maven Central under the
[`org.apache.maven.doxia`](https://central.sonatype.com/namespace/org.apache.maven.doxia) group ID. To write a Maven
site you don't need to download anything: the Maven Site Plugin brings Doxia with it.

To use Doxia in your own code, add the modules you need as dependencies, for example:

```xml
<dependency>
  <groupId>org.apache.maven.doxia</groupId>
  <artifactId>doxia-module-markdown</artifactId>
  <version>${doxiaVersion}</version>
</dependency>
```

Source releases of each component, with their signatures, are listed on the download page of the component:
[Doxia](./doxia/download.html), [Doxia Sitetools](./doxia-sitetools/download.html) and
[Doxia Converter](./doxia-tools/doxia-converter/download.html).
